 "notes": "All five planned kinds kept (Mechanical and Vintage electronic calculator are new). Old Olivetti Lettera 32 became a version of Lettera 22; old slide-rule models Hemmi 259D, Sun Hemmi 80K, Otis King Model K, K&E Deci-Lon became versions; Faber-Castell 111/54A Addiator moved to Mechanical calculator (it is a slide adder). Old soroban became an archetype. Left out for lack of a retrieved page: Facit calculators (pages blocked or empty), Olympia SM4/SG-1, Smith-Corona Clipper/Galaxie, Hermes Baby designer, Remington Portable No. 2, K&E 4081 dates. Olivetti and Faber-Castell brand facts from knowledge."
}